erland-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years since 1951. On that same middle, January to February came in at 57% of normal in 2025 and May to June at 133% in 2025. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 33% of normal on the middle of the grids. July to August is the wettest pair at 10.77 inches normal, and October to November is the driest at 6.00.</p>"}
